                                                "sense_id": "6b27622e-f68d-3d64-8898-28b3f32de68a",
                                                "text": "You were coming out of the Italian Opera, ma’am, in white satin and jewels, a blaze of splendour, when I hadn’t a penny to buy a link to light you.’"
                                            },
